; A rift a Skeleton Summoner opens in the floor, that one of the dungeon's own climbs
; out of when it lands -- the meteor's mark again, and a thing in the world for the
; same reasons. What climbs out, how soon and for how long are the skill's: see
; DungeonSkill SkeletonSummoner Q.
Projectile
  Name = SummoningRift
  DisplayName = Rift
  VisionRange = 0
  SummoningUpdate
  End


; The rift it opens, lying on the floor until something climbs out. Like the healer's
; light it lies still and long enough to be taken as landing when it goes, so the
; column rises on the frame the skeleton does.
  Height = 1
  Tint = 0xA050F0
  Effect = SummoningRift
  EffectOffset = 0
End
